when they scan the barcode.

00:35:56.600 --> 00:36:01.220
And once it passes through the
Lightning Mobile stack here,

00:36:01.220 --> 00:36:06.800
this is the result. There is
definitely much more clarity,

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:09.800
and more importantly, there's
no loss of productivity

00:36:09.800 --> 00:36:12.420
when the operator tries
to do that first scan.

00:36:12.420 --> 00:36:14.880
There's no manual
re-entry of the code.

00:36:14.880 --> 00:36:18.910
So let me go through a
