00:36:56.860 --> 00:37:01.300
with the Google Cloud
technique of building AI models

00:37:01.300 --> 00:37:03.820
on their data science platform.

00:37:03.820 --> 00:37:06.640
What does it do for us
as industrial operators,

00:37:06.640 --> 00:37:08.110
as industrial users?

00:37:08.110 --> 00:37:11.320
It opens up this whole
universe, this whole expanse

00:37:11.320 --> 00:37:12.432
of use cases.

00:37:12.432 --> 00:37:14.890
Sastry talked a little bit
about sensor fusion in the past,

00:37:14.890 --> 00:37:20.093
