00:37:20.093 --> 00:37:21.260
What are the newer insights?

00:37:21.260 --> 00:37:22.930
For example, if you're
from oil and gas,

00:37:22.930 --> 00:37:24.850
and you have a
technician walking around

00:37:24.850 --> 00:37:27.820
in your refinery, he could
take an Android mobile device,

00:37:27.820 --> 00:37:30.090
